{"ref":"BDB, לְבָנָה","hw":"לְבָנָה","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לְבָנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. moon</strong>, poet. <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.</em><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.23\">Is 24:23</a> + 2 times; shall pale before <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.23\">Is 24:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמָּה</span>); shall become like sun <span dir=\"rtl\">(חַמָּה)</span> in day of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s redemption <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.26\">30:26</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אוֹר הַלְּ׳)</span>; sim. of woman’s beauty, <span dir=\"rtl\">יָפָה כַלְּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:10\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.10\">Ct 6:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמָּה</span>).","next":"BDB, לָבָן²","prev":"BDB, לָבָן"}